  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder with multimodal singleprofile (config_028) achieves the highest accuracy (0.536). This experiment tests extending this promising setup to multiprofile settings while using avgpool aggregation (a common method for multi-profile data) and concat fusion (same as config_028). It isolates the impact of profile setting (single vs multi) and aggregation method, which are critical design choices with limited prior evidence. This balances exploitation of the scvi_n200 RNA encoder's potential with exploration of multiprofile scalability."
